## **Custom-Theme-Colors Plugin: Thorough Exploration Report**

### **1. EXACT PATH & PACKAGE DETAILS**

**Location:** [plugins/pantoken/custom-theme-colors](plugins/pantoken/custom-theme-colors)

**Package Name:** `@pantoken/plugin-custom-theme-colors`

**Version:** 0.3.1

**Package.json (key fields):**
```json
{
  "name": "@pantoken/plugin-custom-theme-colors",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "description": "pantoken plugin: custom theme color rules and hero/brand variables for site theme color selection.",
  "type": "module",
  "sideEffects": ["**/*.css"],
